<div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">Science</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/b50c19a81c997c69d0395143cde67dee-Screenshot 2026-04-01 at 11.32.33 AM.png" style="width:100px; height:100px; object-fit:contain;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 12px 12px 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4;">
AI connects to science through models, evidence, classification, and prediction. Students can study how AI uses data to recognize patterns and generate predictions while considering limitations and the role of human judgment.
</div>
</details>

<!-- Computer Science & Engineering -->
<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
