</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 12px 12px 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4;">
AI connects through algorithms, machine learning, and system design. Students can explore how AI systems are built and how design choices and data impact accuracy, behavior, and fairness.
</div>
</details>

<!-- Arts -->
<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
