</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 12px 12px 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4;">
AI connects to the arts through creativity, style, and originality. Students can compare AI-generated content with human work and explore authorship, expression, and meaning.
</div>
</details>

<!-- World Languages -->
<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
