AI connects through fitness tracking and health tools. Students can evaluate AI-generated advice and consider privacy, accuracy, and the need for human judgment in health decisions.
</div>
</details>

<!-- CTE -->
<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
